# Feralas - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans and manuals whose SOURCE is physically in
# Feralas, verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever
# item vendor and drop tables). Thirteen recipes are vendor-sold by in-zone
# Alliance or neutral vendors (Logannas, Brienna Starglow, Pratt McGrubben,
# Vivianna, Zorbin Fandazzle); eleven more drop each from a single named
# in-zone mob, ten of them Feralas-only, one honestly noted as also dropping
# in Thousand Needles. The six Jangdor-only patterns are excluded - he is a
# Horde-faction vendor (Alterac precedent). Two high-level world-boss drops
# are excluded as out of reach. Everything else Feralas-dropping is a
# generic multi-zone world drop, and quest records carry no reward data, so
# neither ships (see docs/feralas-companions-inventory.md and
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Fishing has no Feralas
# source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/feralas-recipes
title Feralas - Recipes & Patterns
levels 38-50
zone Feralas
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords feralas, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Feathermoon vendors - Logannas's stock (Alchemy)

  zone map 1444

  when skill Alchemy 1

  tip Logannas (32.67, 44.03) sells recipes in Feathermoon Stronghold.
  buy 6057 "Recipe: Nature Protection Potion"
  buy 9302 "Recipe: Ghost Dye"

step Far east vendor - Brienna's stock (Tailoring)

  zone map 1444

  when skill Tailoring 1

  tip Brienna Starglow (88.96, 45.95) sells patterns at the far east edge.
  buy 7089 "Pattern: Azure Silk Cloak"
  buy 253665 "Pattern: Linen Reagent Bag"
  buy 253668 "Pattern: Woolen Reagent Bag"

step Feathermoon vendors - Pratt's stock (Leatherworking)

  zone map 1444

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  tip Pratt McGrubben (30.63, 42.71) sells patterns in Feathermoon Stronghold (a Horde vendor elsewhere sells the same stock; the Alliance source is Pratt).
  buy 7451 "Pattern: Green Whelp Bracers"
  buy 8385 "Pattern: Turtle Scale Gloves"
  buy 15734 "Pattern: Living Shoulders"

