step Center vendor - Zorbin's stock (Engineering)

  zone map 1444

  when skill Engineering 1

  tip Zorbin Fandazzle (44.81, 43.42), neutral, sells schematics in the center.
  buy 19027 "Schematic: Snake Burst Firework"

step North coast - enchanted Sorceress (Enchanting)

  zone map 1444

  when skill Enchanting 1

  loop
  goto 23.78,62.42
  goto 24.35,65.39
  kill 5336 optional
  collect 249513 "Formula: Enchant 2H Weapon - Lesser Strength" optional
  note The Hatecrest Sorceress (level 43) on the north coast is the sole dropper anywhere in the data. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

